Q4. What do these HTTP status codes mean: 200, 301, 404, 500, 403?
~~> 1. 200 :Success
    page ya request succefully load hoga.
    2. 301 : Moved prmentatly
    Website ka address permanently change ho gaya hai. Browser ko naye address pe redirect kar deta hai.
    3.404 : NOt Found 
    jo bhi page find kar rahe he wo agar exists hi nahi karta to ye erro dega.
    4.500 :internal server error
    jab server me kuch interal problem ho user me nahi tab ye errror ata he. jisme wesite kuch foult hota he.
    5.403 : Forbidden
    website  ka agar koi private folder open karne jayenge to ye error show hogi.jiski user ko permission nahi hoti.

